id: perfection-genetic-zenkai
name: Genetic Zenkai
order: 4
slot: trait
# One of these is chosen (the Transformation's row asks).
group: perfect-traits
groupLabel: Perfect Traits
description: >
  Brought back from the brink of death, your power grows beyond measure.
text: >
  Genetic Zenkai: Brought back from the brink of death, your power grows beyond measure.
  (1)-[Passive]: While you are below the Injured Health Threshold, increase your Wound Rolls and Soak Value by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you have used a [Triggered/Defeated] effect this Combat Encounter and are not Defeated after its use, increase your Tier of Power by 1 (see — Breakthrough) until the end of your next turn.

